- POST /api/auth/register/ , /api/auth/login/ , GET /api/auth/me/
- /api/brands/ , /api/cars/
- /api/clients/
- /api/orders/
- /api/reports/kpi/ , /revenue/ , /top-models/ , /manager-load/ , /stock/

